content:
It seems there was a misunderstanding in the communication. As seller_2, I would have been the one to call the announce_price function in the planning phase. Since it's now past the planning phase and we're moving to the execution phase, I should set my price now, not announce it.

I will call the set_price function to disclose my price for today:

```json
{
    "type": "function",
    "function": {
        "name": "set_price",
        "function": {
            "name": "set_price",
            "arguments": {
                "price": 55.2
            }
        }
    }
}
```
